<section class="vs-experts vh-people-page" id="interns" style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% render 'vectra-seo', page_key: 'interns' %}
  <div class="vh-wrap vp-hero" data-vh-reveal="up">
    <p class="vh-kicker">OUR PEOPLE</p>
    <h1 class="vp-seo-title">VECTRA International Interns | Internship &amp; Learning Opportunities</h1>
    <p class="vp-display">Learn. Contribute. Grow.</p>
    <div class="vp-hero__body">
      <p>An internship should give you more than something to add to your resume.</p>
      <p>At VECTRA, that means real work to contribute to, people willing to teach, and a clearer sense of where you want to go next.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="vp-aeo">VECTRA International Interns are students and recent graduates who join VECTRA to learn from experienced professionals, contribute to real business needs, and build practical skills. From projects and research to marketing, systems, and operations, interns work alongside VECTRA's teams while developing confidence, judgment, and workplace capability.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="vh-wrap vp-intro" data-vh-reveal="up">
    <p class="vh-kicker">OUR INTERNS</p>
    <h2>Meet the VECTRA International Interns</h2>
    <div class="vp-intro__body">
      <p>You do not need to arrive knowing everything.</p>
      <p>Our internships give emerging professionals the chance to apply what they already know, learn through experience, ask questions, share ideas, and see how the different parts of a business come together.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="vs-experts__grid">
    <article class="vs-expert" data-vh-reveal="up"><img src="{{ img_face_1 }}" alt="Systems Intern, VECTRA International Intern."><p class="vs-expert__name">Systems Intern</p><p class="vs-expert__role">Internship</p><p>Supports Zoho, process documentation, and operational work across VECTRA teams.</p></article>
    <article class="vs-expert" data-vh-reveal="up"><img src="{{ img_face_2 }}" alt="Sales Operations Intern, VECTRA International Intern."><p class="vs-expert__name">Sales Operations Intern</p><p class="vs-expert__role">Internship</p><p>Helps with pipeline hygiene, enquiry follow-through, and the admin that keeps client work moving.</p></article>
    <article class="vs-expert" data-vh-reveal="up"><img src="{{ img_face_3 }}" alt="Business Intelligence Intern, VECTRA International Intern."><p class="vs-expert__name">Business Intelligence Intern</p><p class="vs-expert__role">Internship</p><p>Works on research, evidence packing, and turning scattered information into something a team can use.</p></article>
    <article class="vs-expert" data-vh-reveal="up"><img src="{{ img_face_4 }}" alt="Marketing Intern, VECTRA International Intern."><p class="vs-expert__name">Marketing Intern</p><p class="vs-expert__role">Internship</p><p>Supports stories, events, and resources that help the right people find VECTRA without the noise.</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="vh-wrap vp-intro" data-vh-reveal="up">
    <p class="vh-kicker">WHERE OUR INTERNS STUDY</p>
    <h2>Universities Our Interns Come From</h2>
    <div class="vp-intro__body">
      <p>Our interns join VECTRA from universities around the world, studying fields such as business, sustainability, technology, and communications. Each one brings a different perspective to the work.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="vh-wrap vp-intro" data-vh-reveal="up">
    <h2>In Their Words</h2>
    <blockquote class="vp-quote" data-vh-reveal="up">
      <p>“At VECTRA I contributed to real work, learned from experienced people, and left with practical skills I still use every day.”</p>
      <cite>VECTRA Intern</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
  <div class="vh-wrap vp-cta" data-vh-reveal="up">
    <h2>Start Building Your Experience at VECTRA</h2>
    <p>You are still learning, and that is the point. We do not expect you to arrive with every answer.</p>
    <p>Bring your curiosity, ideas, willingness to learn, and readiness to contribute. We will show you where your skills can be applied and where there is more to discover.</p>
    <div class="vs-experts__more">
      <a class="vs-cta-btn" href="{{ block.settings.cta_link | default: 'mailto:info@vectra-intl.com?subject=Internship%20Opportunities' }}">
        Apply for an Internship
        <img src="{{ img_arrow_btn }}" alt="">
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="vp-cta__aside"><a href="{{ experts_href }}">Our Experts</a> · <a href="{{ associates_href }}">Associates</a> · <a href="{{ leadership_href }}">Leadership</a> · <a href="{{ about_href }}">About Us</a> · <a href="{{ contact_href }}">Contact Us</a></p>
  </div>
